    },
    {
      "speaker": "草壁 萌",
      "text": "［01/12 澄まし｜m10101］おにいちゃん、明日の癒やし家電コーナー、最後に確認してもいい？",
      "expressionId": "01",
      "expressionVariant": "01",
      "expressionLabel": "澄まし",
      "storySprites": [{"id":"am","src":"images/assets/char/m10101.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1}]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "草壁 萌",
      "text": "［02/12 微笑み｜m10201］ふふ。おにいちゃんと一緒なら、準備も楽しいね。",
      "expressionId": "02",
      "expressionVariant": "01",
      "expressionLabel": "微笑み",
      "storySprites": [{"id":"am","src":"images/assets/char/m10201.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1}]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "ところが、萌が作った案内札が、机の上から消えていた。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "草壁 萌",
      "text": "［03/12 怒り｜m10301］もう……誰かが勝手に持っていったなら、ちゃんと返してもらわないと。",
      "expressionId": "03",
      "expressionVariant": "01",
      "expressionLabel": "怒り",
      "storySprites": [{"id":"am","src":"images/assets/char/m10301.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1}]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "草壁 萌",
      "text": "［04/12 悲しみ｜m10401］がんばって書いたのに……なくなっちゃったのかな。",
      "expressionId": "04",
      "expressionVariant": "01",
      "expressionLabel": "悲しみ",
      "storySprites": [{"id":"am","src":"images/assets/char/m10401.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1}]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "大丈夫。一緒に探せば見つかるよ。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "草壁 萌",
      "text": "［05/12 笑顔｜m10501］うん。ありがとう、おにいちゃん。私、もう一度探してみるね。",
      "expressionId": "05",
      "expressionVariant": "01",
      "expressionLabel": "笑顔",
      "storySprites": [{"id":"am","src":"images/assets/char/m10501.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1}]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "萌がタロットカードを一枚引くと、描かれていたのは『戦車』だった。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "草壁 萌",
      "text": "［06/12 驚き｜m10601］えっ……戦車？　もしかして、台車の近くにあるってこと？",
      "expressionId": "06",
      "expressionVariant": "01",
      "expressionLabel": "驚き",
      "storySprites": [{"id":"am","src":"images/assets/char/m10601.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1}]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "当たっていたらすごいな。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "草壁 萌",
      "text": "［07/12 照れ｜m10701］そ、そんなに見つめないで。占いが外れたら、恥ずかしいから……。",
      "expressionId": "07",
      "expressionVariant": "01",
      "expressionLabel": "照れ",
      "storySprites": [{"id":"am","src":"images/assets/char/m10701.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1}]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "草壁 萌",
      "text": "［08/12 期待｜m10801］でも、少しだけ信じてみよう？　おにいちゃん、台車置き場まで一緒に来て。",
      "expressionId": "08",
      "expressionVariant": "01",
      "expressionLabel": "期待",
      "storySprites": [{"id":"am","src":"images/assets/char/m10801.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1}]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "台車の下から、札につけた緑色のリボンがのぞいていた。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "草壁 萌",
      "text": "［09/12 得意げ・差分1｜m10901］ほら、見つけた。私の占い、ちゃんと当たったでしょう？",
      "expressionId": "09",
      "expressionVariant": "01",
      "expressionLabel": "得意げ",
      "storySprites": [{"id":"am","src":"images/assets/char/m10901.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1}]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "草壁 萌",
      "text": "［09/12 得意げ・差分2｜m10902］えへへ……今日は少しだけ、おねぇちゃんみたいに頼れたかな。",
      "expressionId": "09",
      "expressionVariant": "02",
      "expressionLabel": "得意げ",
      "storySprites": [{"id":"am","src":"images/assets/char/m10902.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1}]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "店長が札を拾うと、裏側にべったりと古い粘着テープが残っていた。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "草壁 萌",
      "text": "［10/12 軽い嫌悪・差分1｜m11001］うぅ……これは、そのまま売り場に戻したくないな。",
      "expressionId": "10",
      "expressionVariant": "01",
      "expressionLabel": "軽い嫌悪",
      "storySprites": [{"id":"am","src":"images/assets/char/m11001.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1}]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "草壁 萌",
      "text": "［10/12 軽い嫌悪・差分2｜m11002］おにいちゃん、その手で私のカードには触らないでね……？",
      "expressionId": "10",
      "expressionVariant": "02",
      "expressionLabel": "軽い嫌悪",
      "storySprites": [{"id":"am","src":"images/assets/char/m11002.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1}]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "草壁 萌",
      "text": "［11/12 心配不安｜m11101］きれいに剥がせるかな。札まで破れたら、作り直しになっちゃう……。",
      "expressionId": "11",
      "expressionVariant": "01",
      "expressionLabel": "心配不安",
      "storySprites": [{"id":"am","src":"images/assets/char/m11101.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1}]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "店長が慎重にテープを剥がした瞬間、勢い余って札が宙を舞った。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "草壁 萌",
      "text": "［12/12 動揺｜m11201］わ、わっ！　おにいちゃん、そっち！　落とさないで……！",
      "expressionId": "12",
      "expressionVariant": "01",
      "expressionLabel": "動揺",
      "storySprites": [{"id":"am","src":"images/assets/char/m11201.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1}]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "店長は間一髪で札を受け止めた。二人で新しいテープへ貼り替え、準備は無事に整った。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "草壁 萌",
      "text": "見つかってよかった。おにいちゃん、最後まで手伝ってくれてありがとう。",
      "expressionId": "02",
      "expressionVariant": "01",
      "expressionLabel": "微笑み",
      "storySprites": [{"id":"am","src":"images/assets/char/m10201.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1}]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "【確認完了】萌の現行12表情・全14画像をすべて表示しました。"
